  "description": "Design a map sum structure that supports inserting key-value pairs and returning the sum of all values whose keys start with a given prefix.",
  "pseudocode": "1: function insert(key, val) {\n2:   let curr = root;\n3:   for (let char of key) {\n4:     if (!curr.children[char]) curr.children[char] = new Node();\n5:     curr = curr.children[char];\n6:     curr.sum += val;\n7:   }\n8: }\n9: function sum(prefix) {\n10:  let curr = root;\n11:  for (let char of prefix) {\n12:    if (!curr.children[char]) return 0;\n13:    curr = curr.children[char];\n14:  }\n15:  return curr.sum;\n16: }",
